elines Screenshot (1).png", "id": "3915626092078551", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499296127_3915626095411884_5364719753103044987_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jJlcOuGblUIQ7kNvwFQqYir&_nc_oc=AdrAhbm7uhgIBVBbf0_IWoywz2MPLdkEyJq_RtB6PMSmEzTq6d35IN67cwuflbrHoDQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLMOjL3MbRkeB9Iibz8H-8L067SZwhvIX2XcRmnWKnscg&oe=6A9C325A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Blade City Brand Assets Cover.png", "id": "1655153859945519", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310667_1655153863278852_7997685239185590787_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mdEXDMdAymIQ7kNvwFFUhX_&_nc_oc=AdpXGhH-IG4SLQsNHMVALxwmd0QNEiP8ccnXWabOylZ7zgoKOrhwPn9ltc5hWusc_5g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ7YhGoWd2PlNmzW-DbcOV-sLaCkSLZKsd9RA_Hq0XS-Q&oe=6A9C3591"}, "display_name": "Blade City", "keywords": ["sports", "social", "sandbox", "platformer"], "long_description": "A rookie Ninja Monkey with a rusty blade, an empty wallet, and one impossible dream...to become the Master of the Blades \ud83e\udd77\n\nDodge & deflex \u2694\ufe0f in every match to win coins \ud83d\udcb0 \n\nSpend coins to upgrade blades, slay-high abilities, aura \u2728\n\nCoins also unlock mini-games across the city \ud83d\udd79\ufe0f\n\nSkate. Slice. Socialize \ud83d\udef9 \ud83c\udf54  \ud83c\udf63 \n\nGet rich\ud83d\udcb0. Get jacked \ud83d\udcaa. Throw rooftop parties \ud83c\udf89 . Flex \ud83e\udea9\n{1899581750729344}\n\n{2088024375447461}\n\nWanna help us build arena maps, blades, and expand this Ninja City? \ud83e\udd1d\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f\n\nJoin discord.gg/playbladecity\n\n{1714375429586515}", "short_description": "Become the ultimate Ninja Monkey in Blade City! \ud83e\udd77\ud83d\udc35\nYou have a blade. Everyone else has a blade. Good luck! \u2694\ufe0f"}]}, "developer_name": "Blade Lab", "developer_privacy_policy_ur